明るい、普通の女子学園生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若さならではのハリがあって肌も瑞々しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その清楚さから、ターゲットに選ばれてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、その清楚さにはどこか影があって……？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"215590"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c24d01ce6f94f535374c6c5e3ded42c9be493ad74e6b85151362c53f8240c4cd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/9216bf314367877ed7810b4a05980953692eddf9d1823c4cbfe836934a7f83a7.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日アン(春乃うらら)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224347:215590:6480:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26694","characterName":"国分寺 琴美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"52456","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"211396"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15224"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26694"},"originalCharacterName":"国分寺 琴美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"30"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"99"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"94"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"67"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の叔母。30歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚してすぐに愛する夫が他界し、現在は未亡人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供が出来なかったため、夫の実家から離縁され、国分寺家に戻ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物腰柔らかく、優しい性格で、滅多なことでは怒らない、何でも受け入れてくれる懐の深い女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他界した夫は仕事で忙しく、家を空けることが多かったため、彼女はセックス経験が少ない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15224","sourceWorkId":"12554","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しくて柔らかな大人の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"忍耐強く、怒らずに何事も受け入れる性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ご主人を2年前に亡くしたが、子供が出来なかったためご主人側の実家から離縁され性が国分寺に戻っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"琴美の夫は商社マンで、結婚後も出張で自宅には居なかっため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"SEXは数少なく性的には未開発。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"52456"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/fff8a4e9d5d5946291a63a9a78d4926d3afca84b738f31c146ff2554eb60eaee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/278cd73f803997b97d25765eb5044a490a350aeb0f432d0a10b4c0c875d8d33b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日 アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日アン(春乃うらら)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33264","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26695","characterName":"国分寺 紅葉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"52457","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"211396"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15225"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26695"},"originalCharacterName":"国分寺 紅葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"102"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じ大学に通う女子大生にして、主人公の従妹。20歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物静かで大人しく、内向的な性格だが、激しい気性を内に秘め、爆発すると何を仕出かすかわからない、そんな危うさを持つ女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひとつ年上の主人公を「お兄ちゃん」と呼んで慕い、幼い頃からずっと恋心を抱いていた。そのため、男性との交際経験はなく、当然、処女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15225","sourceWorkId":"12554","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ込み思案で口数が少ない、内向的な図書委員的なタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆっくりまったりした性格だが、激しい気性を内に秘め、爆発すると何をするかわからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひとつ年上の主人公をお兄ちゃんと慕い、幼い頃から恋心を抱いていたため、今まで男性経験はゼロ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お兄ちゃんのお嫁さんになるのが何よりも夢で、主人公と一緒にいたいために同じ大学に入った。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"52457"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/3465696caaf28b6634f90212f622fbada1440e3ce9a1435e1bff0463b7ae4b6d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0aec464729297876061dbb8a3248bcc5ff15587a17855129c9ce5ae839d0b1ad.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩泉 まい","creatorId":"vndb:s666","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s666","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s666","name":"岩泉まい(樋口まゆら、樋口まゆ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33265","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26696","characterName":"脇坂 佳奈絵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"215596","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224351"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15554"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26696"},"originalCharacterName":"脇坂 佳奈絵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"22"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"98"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"95"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"68"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が性調教を依頼された人妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚二年目の22歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子短大を卒業して入社した一流企業のOL時代に出会った先輩社員と結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"裕福な家庭に生まれ、親の躾が行き届いた、俗にいう“育ちの良い娘”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほんわかした雰囲気で、性格もほわわんとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"短大時代に付き合っていた恋人と数回程度のセックス経験しかなく、性に対して未成熟。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旦那とのセックスもほとんどマグロ状態だが、彼女自身は十分満足している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15554","sourceWorkId":"12224","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢22歳。　（Ｂ：98 Ｗ：68 Ｈ：95）（Ｅカップ）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほんわか、ほんわかした夢の中に生きるような女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"問題なく女子短大を卒業し、一流企業のＯＬとなり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのまま上司の勧めで先輩社員と結婚した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供の頃からそれなりに裕福な家庭で育ったため、親の躾が行き届いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性経験は、短大生になってから一人だけ恋人が居たが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"数回しかセックスはしていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚してからも、夫に求められるままセックスをしているが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本は大の字になって遊ばれているだけのマグロ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな性生活に、佳奈絵は十分満足しているのだった……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"215596"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91a7cb257aa2b0b8ffb73325141697a4300905a871f0a4255a0290a70fc4cd69.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b7561cb8dcd4ea17c076f07cc949c0aabd389a39a007c5f74ce79fce4725b600.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"汐風 よる","creatorId":"vndb:s4746","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4746","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4746","name":"汐風 よる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33266","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26697","characterName":"平野 しずか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"215597","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224351"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15555"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26697"},"originalCharacterName":"平野 しずか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"105"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"99"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"73"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"佳奈絵の隣に住む人妻。29歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとした上品の奥様だが、それなりに酸いも甘いも知る年齢であるためか、言葉にトゲがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"佳奈絵を調教する主人公と出会い、彼女自身も凌辱の対象になってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、旦那とは最近セックスレスらしく、まだまだ現役の熟れた肉体を持て余し、盛りのついた牝猫のように性的快楽を渇望していたため、その主人公の凌辱を悦んで受け入れてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、いつの間にか主人公の協力者になって、佳奈絵を甚振る側に……!?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15555","sourceWorkId":"12224","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢29歳。（Ｂ：105、Ｗ：73、Ｈ：99）（Ｆカップ）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとり、おっとりした上品な奥様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それなりに長く生きているため、言うことはキツく厳しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ご主人とは最近セックスレスで、盛りのついたメス猫以上に性的に渇望していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公から凌辱されても、開き直って楽しんでしまい"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつの間にか、主人公の協力者になってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"佳奈絵をいたぶる側に回ることも……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"215597"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe769ee2af04583525a426b0881786a4500bb19dff857fe76e17fc7301c5aa06.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a3b81597479082e821d046522cd952ff383b8f8bebafc06e9ce795da24d0147.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p680","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2186","canonicalEntityId"